      "lineNbr": 451,
      "author": {
        "id": 1087303
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-15T22:10:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They are. But the way we write bytestream to the disk is sensitive to write/read order. On the disk it looks like [image1_content][image2_content][image3_content] so we cannot write/read in arbitrary order. At least not until we index the byte stream properly.",
      "parentUuid": "873cb29f_f4e71080",
